Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has got to be a new\Nworld record for butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm the official\Nbutt cleaner here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just a little bit of tar juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Yani!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your fucking mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah? I um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mix up when Rent\Nwas due again, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.30,0:01:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake pack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.08,0:01:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.99,0:01:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just be careful next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.98,0:01:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like it's\Nsomebody's lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little moist, but listen,\Na butt is a butt, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.66,0:01:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.74,0:01:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, it's fine. Yeah. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, nice, nice kitty, soft kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?! Why, God, why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's over, I'll just be able to do it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just be able
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To do it 3-4-0-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of cigarettes doesn't\Nhave any gaps in it. Thing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is in their natural\Nform these little babies
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are packed in here to\Nthe brim it takes about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,five cigarettes and then\Nyou've got a perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,marshmallowy home for\Nyour cheapo lighter if you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ask me, this is how every single\Nbox of cigarettes should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but oh so temporary
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dang it they packed this one\Nand pretty tight, it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouch, a meowsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding the world's\Ncruelty is my superpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three-second rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't all get\Ncovered in sidewalk poo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's tight this month too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's fine if I\Njust cut off the tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beast Folk Temps, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eyes up here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what you all will\Nbe taking care of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by the way, we prohibit all types\Nof tobacco products at our facility,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we'll take that till your shift ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.30,0:05:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did number 56 go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's long gone. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that cat had was 30 more minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.06,0:06:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the Beast Folk\Ngig worker helping today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vase you'll be cleaning is\Nconsidered a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see a speck of dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't get your animal smell on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider it darn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nyeh. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could it possibly be dirtier\Nthan before you started cleaning it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it smells like it's been sitting\Nin front of a disgusting train station!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.66,0:07:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You waste of space!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a whole 170 yen to\Nmy name and six cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it'll be six days till\Nmy next part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to\Nlive on only 28 yen a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One cigarette every 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet I can just make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my first and last of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I smoke, I feel\Nlike I'm trouble-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making it six days on\N170 yen ain't no thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have figured. Well, I guess just\Na cig a day is harder in its own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably easier just to go cold turkey
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out there is still lookin' out for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1,160 Yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Yani? Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How've you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wanted to see what you were\Nup to and hear your voices all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since\NI've seen you, so, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, want to come over and hang out a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not get crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.06,0:09:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True or false, your entire\Napartment smells awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The floors are totally\Nnot covered in ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just grab your phone\Nand send me a pic, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look at your pristine place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pristine it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.26,0:10:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a bad luck magnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see a lot of smoking potential here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! Thank you, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've made me the happiest cat on Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that right there is some good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She sent one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who won fastest room cleanup today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the tidiest room I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A for effort, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When family starts making us stink,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it might be time to try a\Nlittle harder to quit smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.06,0:11:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, reading can just fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And boop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one works great, then\Nhow about more than one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.92,0:11:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't touched a\Ncigarette in three whole days?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way you were smoking,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd think your lungs survived\Non nicotine instead of oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:11:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No biggie. It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has got to be the single\Ngreatest accomplishment of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making me blush, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weekday afternoon beers\Nare so the bestest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart-shaped smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is giving me good Omen vibes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need something, you walking ashtray?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:12:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just spreading all the good vibes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need booze and I need\Ncigarettes, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go get me some?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm really trying to\Nfinish my homework right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.84,0:13:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little bookworm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that learning making you\Nfeel like a big shot, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your head out of all these books!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second you finish middle school,\NYou're going straight to work, but I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bust my hump to make sure you've\Ngot a roof over your freaking head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think a kid would be\Ngrateful and get his old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go straight
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You in there
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh for crying out loud.\NI can't believe my own
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flesh and blood would\Ngang up on me with the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,landlord to tell me how
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much i reek
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taking a bath
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is nothing more than\Nmoist pain pain up my butt
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.86,0:14:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But once you get in the water,\Nyou do feel pretty refreshed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bath's like a car wash for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I might be earning\Nmy clean freak badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bath is the yin, and having a\Nsmoke afterwards is the tasty yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, it's chilly, and my throat hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me I'm sick now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's definitely a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cigarettes taste like trash,\Nthough smoking is out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take me sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:15:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can barely get through menthols.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.76,0:16:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help! Please don't! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just had to run away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I came all this\Nway to check up on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like a secret agent\Nfrom the health department.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta admit, people don't\Nusually show up in hazmat suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, stop reeking of cigarettes then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it is okay to clean up after yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cigarettes and garbage\Nmake a pretty stinky team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How bad are you feeling now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing a little better than yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go make you some rice porridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She could be a little nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody made her come visit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that means she's got a\Nsoft spot for me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.42,0:17:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The porridge is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Yanni?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry. Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my mask! I need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you fucking kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really that stinky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That actually hurts my feelings a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, looky here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howdy, Imoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kansai, hi, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for always looking\Nout for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's sweet of you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really that\Nthing's younger sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big sis got some sort\Nof bug and feels gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And little sis doesn't\Nwant to get sick too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, coming all that way\Njust to help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would believe that thing\Ncould even catch a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.92,0:18:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's funny, but she's pretty\Ngood at catching a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like when she eats 50\Npopsicles in one sitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or jumps into the snow in her pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when she gets sick, I\Nalways have to take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not the easiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A shame you have to come all that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you gotta do is call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Appreciate the offer, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how much of a burden\Nshe can end up being sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I think it's best for everyone if\NI'm the one who takes care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.64,0:19:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so cute, I could adopt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, what? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.16,0:19:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Doctor, you're saying her lungs are...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going to die. That's for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got two months to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could even make it three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe a bit longer is possible, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About a hundred days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hundred... cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Imoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.76,0:19:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare make my little sis cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's your lungs that\Nare making her cry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all die one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty simple equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NO SMOKING IN THE FUCKING\NHOSPITAL, YOU GODDAMN BEASTFOLK!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a dream, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lung cancer and 100 days was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.26,0:20:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem a little sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did your cold come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.24,0:20:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.07,0:20:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to chat, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But take care of your health, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little sis! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:21:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna quit smoking for real this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.98,0:21:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.66,0:21:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, you can even\Nsee the Milky Way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.92,0:21:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if things ever get tough,\Nremember, you can always call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're under the same sky. So\Nthere's no need to feel alone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.64,0:21:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost looks like cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.02,0:21:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.58,0:21:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a foosh, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a lighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just light?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.52,0:21:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you said you were gonna quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.38,0:22:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.90,0:23:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.86,0:23:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.78,0:23:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.86,0:24:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.52,0:24:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

